## قواعد الاختبار المتقدمة

### 1. استخدام Mock Objects

**للمحاكاة:**
```dart
class MockApiClient extends Mock implements ApiClient {}

void main() {
  group('UserCubit Tests', () {
    late UserCubit userCubit;
    late MockApiClient mockApiClient;
    
    setUp(() {
      mockApiClient = MockApiClient();
      userCubit = UserCubit(mockApiClient);
    });
    
    test('should emit loaded state when users are loaded', () async {
      // Arrange
      when(() => mockApiClient.getUsers()).thenAnswer((_) async => mockUsers);
      
      // Act
      userCubit.loadUsers();
      
      // Assert
      expect(userCubit.state, UserState.loaded(mockUsers));
    });
  });
}
```

